<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results</p>
<p>from the Swiss Open on Wednesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-3</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat 3-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
<p>8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Fernando Vicente (Spain)</p>
<p>2-6 6-3 6-4.</p>
</text>
